SafeSpawn for Sunrise (version 0.5.0)

A port of SafeSpawn 1.0.0 by Tokimi, CozyStudios.
Original source: https://github.com/CozyCord/SafeSpawn (named in the jar; no longer public)
Original licence: CC0-1.0

Ported to Minecraft 26.3 by lavoide, and to Sunrise by arismoko: the rules are re-implemented in
Rust on Sunrise's mod API (no Java code is included). The jar names CC0-1.0 and ships no licence
file; LICENSE is the CC0 1.0 text.
